{"publicId":"d722e6d6-c9e8-41d7-8022-9d834ba60652","title":"加州全面禁止Waymo高速公路自动驾驶服务，要求6个月内提交技术升级方案","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:00.000Z","digest":"加州DMV于2026年11月11日全面禁止Waymo在州内高速公路运营（基于5月施工区误判和11月警车管制误判），该禁令为永久性质，仅保留其城市道路服务（每周超50万次行程）。此前Waymo曾因同类问题于2023年5月暂停高速公路服务并召回软件，但监管机构强调安全风险高于事故统计，要求企业证明技术改进有效性。加州交通厅设定2027年5月为提交技术升级方案的最后期限，否则可能面临更严厉处罚。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T23:03:16.438Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"加利福尼亚暂停 Waymo 高速公路乘车服务","latestReport":{"id":"p9o4g7g0ch5nlfxhg84l7f08q"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":2,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fG4lAFmEHG5w","title":"加州暂停Waymo高速公路服务","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"p9o4g7g0ch5nlfxhg84l7f08q","title":"加利福尼亚暂停 Waymo 高速公路乘车服务","summary":"自11月11日起，加利福尼亚暂停 Waymo 的高速公路乘车服务，Waymo 表示将继续提供地面街道乘车服务。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"p9o4g7g0ch5nlfxhg84l7f08q","title":"加利福尼亚暂停 Waymo 高速公路乘车服务","summary":"自11月11日起，加利福尼亚暂停 Waymo 的高速公路乘车服务，Waymo 表示将继续提供地面街道乘车服务。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T02:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T07:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T11:00:00.000Z","heat":6.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z","he